{"ref":"BDB, רֶ֫בַע","hw":"רֶ֫בַע","html":"† I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">רֶ֫בַע</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 1:8\" href=\"/Ezekiel.1.8\">Ez 1:8</a></sup> <strong>1. fourth part</strong>. <strong>2.</strong> pl. <strong>four sides</strong>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">ר׳</span> cstr., <em>fourth part</em>, of shekel <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 9:8\" href=\"/I_Samuel.9.8\">1 S 9:8</a>, of hin <a data-ref=\"Exodus 29:40\" href=\"/Exodus.29.40\">Ex 29:40</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  in Ez, pl. sf. <em>four sides</em> (<span dir=\"rtl\">אַרְבַּעַת</span> always preceding): <span dir=\"rtl\">רְבָעָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 43:16\" href=\"/Ezekiel.43.16\">Ez 43:16</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">רְבָעֶיהָ</span> v <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 43:17\" href=\"/Ezekiel.43.17\">17</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">רִבְעֵיהֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 1:8\" href=\"/Ezekiel.1.8\">1:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 10:11\" href=\"/Ezekiel.10.11\">10:11</a>, -<span dir=\"rtl\">הֶן</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 1:17\" href=\"/Ezekiel.1.17\">1:17</a>.","next":"BDB, רֹ֫בַע","prev":"BDB, רָבַע"}